@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get All Forms
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/forms
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Form by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Form by Unique Code
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/code/emp-feedback-2026
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create New Form Definition
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Project Onboarding Feedback",
  "code": "proj-onboard-2026",
  "description": "Feedback form for newly onboarded team members.",
  "category": "Human Resources",
  "status": "Draft",
  "allowMultipleSubmissions": false,
  "allowSaveAsDraft": true,
  "submitButtonText": "Submit Response",
  "cancelButtonText": "Clear Form",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Onboarding Experience",
      "description": "Please share your initial project setup feedback.",
      "visibility": true,
      "displayOrder": 0,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "userName",
          "label": "Full Name",
          "type": "Textbox",
          "placeholder": "e.g. Alice Smith",
          "visibility": true,
          "displayOrder": 0,
          "validations": [
            { "type": "required" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "setupEase",
          "label": "How smooth was your dev environment setup?",
          "type": "RadioButton",
          "visibility": true,
          "displayOrder": 1,
          "validations": [
            { "type": "required" }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "label": "Very Smooth", "value": "very_smooth", "displayOrder": 0 },
            { "label": "Moderate", "value": "moderate", "displayOrder": 1 },
            { "label": "Challenging", "value": "challenging", "displayOrder": 2 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### 5. Update Form Status to 'Published'
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/status/Published
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Update Form Status to 'Archived'
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/status/Archived
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Publish Form (Convenience Endpoint)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/publish
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Unpublish Form (Convenience Endpoint)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/unpublish
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Duplicate Form
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/duplicate
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get Submissions for Form ID 1
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/submissions
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Create a Form Submission for Form ID 1
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responses": [
    {
      "fieldId": 1,
      "value": "Mark Taylor"
    },
    {
      "fieldId": 2,
      "value": "mark.taylor@company.com"
    },
    {
      "fieldId": 3,
      "value": "Engineering"
    },
    {
      "fieldId": 4,
      "value": "very_satisfied"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 12. Delete a Form Submission
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/1/submissions/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Delete Form Definition
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/forms/3
Accept: application/json

###
